schema WorkNode
generation control-1
authority native-kernel
absorbs 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/work_graph.py
absorbs 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/scheduling.py
note cooling is a property of a work edge, not a second scheduler

field id
  type u64
  role identity
  generated true

field kind
  type text
  required true

field source_plane
  type text
  required true

field target_plane
  type text
  required true
  references Plane.plane_id
  note unroutable work is refused at insert, not counted afterward

field subject_ref
  type text
  required true

field source_ref
  type text
  default ""

field priority
  type f64
  default 0

field state
  type enum
  values open leased effected satisfied blocked_external superseded invalidated failed
  default open

field lease_holder
  type text
  nullable true

field lease_expires_at
  type timestamp
  nullable true
  note an expired lease returns the work; planes die

field attention
  type enum
  values hot cooled dormant
  default hot

field reheat_at
  type timestamp
  nullable true

field reheat_on
  type text
  default ""
  note named evidence transition that revives a dormant node

field unchanged_checks
  type u32
  default 0

field superseded_by
  type u64
  nullable true

field closed_at
  type timestamp
  nullable true

transition open leased effected satisfied
transition open blocked_external
transition leased open
transition leased effected
transition blocked_external open
transition any superseded
transition any invalidated
transition any failed

terminal satisfied superseded invalidated failed

invariant satisfaction-requires-receipt
  statement a move to satisfied carries a receipt reference

invariant illegal-transitions-raise
  statement an undefined move is an error, never a silent no-op
  derived-from run6 queue 242 rows all open

invariant cooling-needs-a-way-back
  statement attention may leave hot only with reheat_at or reheat_on set
  derived-from run6 proton attention burn

policy cool-after-unchanged
  threshold 3
  note unchanged checks before a node stops riding in the context cut
